<p>Returns an object's type.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> GetObjectType(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oObject<br />);</div>
